      "statement": "The conformance layer runs each Workers/DO program on workerd and on celld on identical bytes with exactly equal outputs, adding fixtures for every new API surface and ported workerd/Web Platform Test suites, and before a release replays scenarios through the full celld binary in each deployment mode: storage, SQL, alarms, streams, WebSockets, and lifecycle.",
